---
description: Expo APIs, route entrypoints and framework configuration
globs:
  - "app/**/*.ts"
  - "app/**/*.tsx"
  - "app.json"
  - "app.config.*"
  - "package.json"
  - "babel.config.*"
  - "metro.config.*"
  - "tailwind.config.*"
  - "plugins/**/*"
---

For Expo APIs, routing or configuration, use installed versions in
`package.json` and matching Expo documentation (SDK 57:
https://docs.expo.dev/versions/v57.0.0/). Read only the affected API guidance.
`docs/USER_FLOWS.md` and the active task own navigation; use Expo Router routes.

These globs attach to route entrypoints and framework configuration. A pure
TypeScript helper or presentational component does not require an Expo-doc read.
If a file outside these paths changes native/framework behavior, retrieve the
same version-matched guidance based on that effect.
